2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 6 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Then it turns out one side of the obstacle is smaller than the other and as soon as it finds a path that is uniquely closer (as the crow flies) to the goal it focuses only on that one.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:35:22 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 7 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='You could trick it though if you put a dead end behind the right side of the obstacle.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:35:48 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 8 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Then it would go into that corner and have to back all the way out again.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:35:58 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 9 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Interesting', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:36:28 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 10 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='I really need to give all this better consideration', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:36:33 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 11 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='So the Euclidean distance is basically what it uses to prioritize possible paths.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:36:35 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 12 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='But A is pluggable you could use any priority function', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:36:54 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 13 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Not just Euclidean distance', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:37:02 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 14 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Dijkstra is A where it treats all possible paths equally.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:37:27 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 15 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='So it would expand out from the start node in all directions instead of prioritizing the ones in the general direction of the goal node.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:38:10 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 16 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Right', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:39:53 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 17 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='@Mr. Hemlock Basically any of the nodes on the border of the searched area is up for grabs as the next node to search.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:40:10 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 18 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='So it's not like it has a position', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:40:38 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 19 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='So Dijkstra's is closer to flood fill than I thought', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:40:40 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 20 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='It can jump from one end of the search space to the other between two iterations if that's what the heuristic tells it to do.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:41:11 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 21 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='I don't think flood fill keeps track of path information though?', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:42:15 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 22 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Ah you're right', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:42:40 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 23 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='It just determines the area that is connected to the initial node.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:42:51 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 24 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='When Dijkstra finishes you will have the optimal path to every one of those nodes as well.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:43:16 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 25 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Ah that's right', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:43:26 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 26 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='So wait Dijkstra's would be great for premapping', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:43:41 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 27 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Yeah I mean if you have a use case where you want precomputed paths from one point to every other Dijkstra is your man.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:16 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 28 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Because it'd have all that information stored and you could say go from x to y and it would be able to quickly tell you based on that stored info what the best way to get there is', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:17 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 29 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='I mean it could be decent for a little like 2d maze chase game', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:33 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 30 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='It doesn't give you every path to every other path though.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:35 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 31 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='I mean', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:41 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 32 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Every path between any two points.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:47 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 33 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='It's just one to every other.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:53 CST 2019}
