2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 35 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='I getcha', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:45:00 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 36 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='You could run it once for every point of course. But it might be kinda slow.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:45:18 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 37 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Not sure if there's a better alternative.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:45:29 CST 2019}
