2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 40 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Otherwise video games would suffer constantly', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:45:49 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 41 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Well actually I looked into some alternatives fairly recently.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:45:53 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 42 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Dijkstra is a bit unnecessary because it's complete.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:46:01 CST 2019}
