2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 45 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='You just need some good ones.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:46:12 CST 2019}
