2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 1 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='I want to host everything. This is how a normal business owner should interact with the dashboard:They navigate to the website (`aiodash.io`) they click on `Buy now` they subscribe to monthly renewal license through stripe once payment is confirmed a new instance of the dashboard and the discord bot is initialized and a single owner license key is generated and sent along with the website link to the owner then they will be able to generate keys that they can pass to the users of their business', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 10:59:40 CDT 2020}
