2025-04-06 15:06:14 INFO  s.u.e.m.MonopolizingConvoApplication - 	 8 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='Oof feels great that someone can understand my problem', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:01:37 CDT 2020}
