2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 1 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='I mean people generally don't build new desktop apps if they can get away with building web apps instead.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:07:18 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 2 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='I mean that's not really true at all', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:07:28 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 3 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='there are things that webapps suit _better_', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:07:36 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 4 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='but if you take something like twitter for example yes it's webbased but also has apps', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:07:49 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 5 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='Trading software used to be all desktop apps and now it's all web apps.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:08:03 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 6 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='Trading software"?', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:08:09 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 7 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='you mean like stocks?', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:08:14 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 8 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='Yeah software for trading.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:08:15 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 9 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='Yeah.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:08:16 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 10 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='how many people do you know that use stock trading software on a daily basis?', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:08:31 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 11 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='Operations and backoffice GUIs are the same.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:08:34 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 12 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='Well I know a lot.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:08:39 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 13 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='I know roughly zero', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:08:46 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 14 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='But I think it's also representative of a class of applications.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:08:47 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 15 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='well yeah it's representative of stock trading', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:09:01 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 16 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='Maybe not mainstream apps that literally everyone uses but applications used by industry professionals.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:09:36 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 17 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='I'm sure there's tons of similar types of apps in tons of other industries.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:09:52 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 18 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='I honestly haven't come across them', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:10:00 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 19 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='And you wouldn't.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:10:06 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 20 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='Are you sure about that? haha', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:10:11 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 21 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='Because you don't work in those industries.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:10:12 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 22 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='No but there is a relevant industry I do have some experience in: support', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:10:24 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 23 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='I think you're right in some respects', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:10:48 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 24 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='often internal business apps will be webbased', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:10:59 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 25 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='but I wouldn't say that it's a case that these are apps that are hindered by that fact', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:11:13 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 26 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='webapps aren't suitable for every type of application there are a lot of things that just don't suit it at all', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:11:25 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 27 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='so I think it's less of a move towards webapps and more people being smarter about what technologies suit what usecases', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:11:53 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 28 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='There are general conveniences offered by webapps such as being able to quickly deploy updates and offloading resources from user machines.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:12:08 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 29 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='Not all apps require this but a lot do.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:12:18 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 30 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='It is useful in some cases yes', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:12:25 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 31 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='but that has tradeoffs too', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:12:29 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 32 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='I think it's more the case that there are special use cases for desktop apps rather than special use cases for web apps.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:12:44 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 33 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='for example if your app doesn't need to be connected to the internet all the time to function it probably shouldn't be a webapp', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:12:59 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 34 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='like for argument's sake imagine your calculator was a webapp instead of a desktop app', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:13:58 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 35 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='(which it is)', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:14:11 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 36 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='that's great until something networkwise breaks which will happen', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:14:28 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 37 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='(almost never)', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:14:37 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 38 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='then suddenly you have no calculator', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:14:38 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 39 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='I literally never use an offline calculator.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:14:51 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 40 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='(why is your calculator webbased?)', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:14:54 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 41 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='(it's the one built into Google)', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:15:09 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 42 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='(oh right)', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:15:15 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 43 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='there is one other thing I dislike about webapps', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:15:26 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 44 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='they don't look native', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:15:28 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 45 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='sometimes you can build something very intuitively with a native UI which otherwise would need a tutorial to work with as a webapp', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:15:56 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 46 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='I'm not sure about the specifics of your argument but I feel like this is a solvable problem if it does indeed happen.', sender='Hernan', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:16:29 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 47 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='I'm not entirely sure', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:16:37 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 48 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=734, text='WinUI attempts to solve this problem', sender='Jonas', sentTime=Wed Nov 20 12:16:42 CST 2019}
