2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 35 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=816, text='Because we know that the focus spot will be generally in focus that's all well and good. But if the edges connected to it (so the rest of someone's body the soccer ball being kicked what have you) blur out then that'd be the issue. I think that your best bet is starting with the focus point figuring out what it's detecting via edge detection then checking the variation there', sender='Darious', sentTime=Fri Nov 22 20:29:25 CST 2019}
