2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 1 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Gotcha', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:32:48 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 2 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/Weighted_A_star_with_eps_5.gif', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:33:11 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 3 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Does it reevaluate previously found nodes based on new data?', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:34:15 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 4 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='When it runs into the corner and backs up it's paying an equal amount of attention to all possible paths that have the same Euclidean distance to the goal node.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:34:23 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 5 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Like in the gif example once it finds the walls does it reconsider the ones it previously went through?', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:34:29 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 6 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Then it turns out one side of the obstacle is smaller than the other and as soon as it finds a path that is uniquely closer (as the crow flies) to the goal it focuses only on that one.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:35:22 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 7 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='You could trick it though if you put a dead end behind the right side of the obstacle.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:35:48 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 8 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Then it would go into that corner and have to back all the way out again.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:35:58 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 9 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Interesting', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:36:28 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 10 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='I really need to give all this better consideration', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:36:33 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 11 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='So the Euclidean distance is basically what it uses to prioritize possible paths.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:36:35 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 12 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='But A is pluggable you could use any priority function', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:36:54 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 13 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Not just Euclidean distance', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:37:02 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 14 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Dijkstra is A where it treats all possible paths equally.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:37:27 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 15 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='So it would expand out from the start node in all directions instead of prioritizing the ones in the general direction of the goal node.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:38:10 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 16 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Right', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:39:53 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 17 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='@Mr. Hemlock Basically any of the nodes on the border of the searched area is up for grabs as the next node to search.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:40:10 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 18 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='So it's not like it has a position', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:40:38 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 19 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='So Dijkstra's is closer to flood fill than I thought', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:40:40 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 20 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='It can jump from one end of the search space to the other between two iterations if that's what the heuristic tells it to do.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:41:11 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 21 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='I don't think flood fill keeps track of path information though?', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:42:15 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 22 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Ah you're right', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:42:40 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 23 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='It just determines the area that is connected to the initial node.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:42:51 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 24 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='When Dijkstra finishes you will have the optimal path to every one of those nodes as well.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:43:16 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 25 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Ah that's right', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:43:26 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 26 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='So wait Dijkstra's would be great for premapping', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:43:41 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 27 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Yeah I mean if you have a use case where you want precomputed paths from one point to every other Dijkstra is your man.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:16 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 28 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Because it'd have all that information stored and you could say go from x to y and it would be able to quickly tell you based on that stored info what the best way to get there is', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:17 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 29 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='I mean it could be decent for a little like 2d maze chase game', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:33 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 30 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='It doesn't give you every path to every other path though.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:35 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 31 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='I mean', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:41 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 32 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Every path between any two points.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:47 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 33 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='It's just one to every other.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:53 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 34 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Oh okay one to many', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:44:59 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 35 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='I getcha', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:45:00 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 36 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='You could run it once for every point of course. But it might be kinda slow.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:45:18 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 37 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Not sure if there's a better alternative.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:45:29 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 38 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Probably.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:45:33 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 39 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='There has to be I'm sure', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:45:40 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 40 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Otherwise video games would suffer constantly', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:45:49 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 41 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Well actually I looked into some alternatives fairly recently.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:45:53 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 42 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Dijkstra is a bit unnecessary because it's complete.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:46:01 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 43 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='You don't usually need EVERY possible path.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:46:08 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 44 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Sure', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:46:11 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 45 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='You just need some good ones.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:46:12 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 46 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='So you could do a probablistic approach.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:46:21 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 47 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='You pick pairs of points at random and run A between them.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:46:29 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 48 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='And store the paths.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:46:34 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 49 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Do that for long enough and you are likely to have a path that's good enough for the route you need to build.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:47:01 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 50 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Weighted towards paths that players are likely to take?', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:47:05 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 51 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='I dunno perhaps?', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:47:17 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 52 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Not necessarily depends on how quick it runs.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:47:23 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 53 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Might be enough to just generate a shitload of paths.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:47:30 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 54 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Well I'm think in terms of a generic shooter. Like x demon trying to get y space marine', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:48:01 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 55 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Just figuring out how they dynamically try to approach you despite you constantly moving and handling obstacles that stuff just does my head in', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:48:36 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 56 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='You can just project a graph on top of the map and do A on the graph', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:49:30 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 57 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='You don't need to search every single pixel', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:49:57 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 58 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='The graph can be fairly coarse', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:50:06 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 59 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Then you can probably do A in realtime', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:50:16 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 60 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Maybe couple that with precomputed paths.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:50:33 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 61 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='On top of possibly telling it to make a beeline if there's no obstacles in the path', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:51:03 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 62 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='If it's a static map you could put a lot of time into precomputing paths I guess.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:51:06 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 63 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Well A will implicitly do that.', sender='Jelissa', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:51:19 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 64 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='I should look into seeing how Dying Light does it with the Virals', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:51:23 CST 2019}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 65 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=597, text='Since those zombies will chase you damn near anywhere', sender='Kosta', sentTime=Tue Dec 17 14:51:32 CST 2019}
