2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 1 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='it depends.', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:21:14 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 2 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='in general IMO if you're writing idiomatic `pandas` then no', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:21:22 CST 2020}
