2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 4 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='the main reason you need to make a copy is assigning to slices', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:21:59 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 5 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='i'm never too sure what idiomatic pandas is... one thing is it sometimes complains about writing over copies and stuff', sender='Asif', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:22:01 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 6 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='yes that's because you've been assigning', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:22:10 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 7 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='e.g. say you want to add a column `sum` that is the sum of `a` and `b`', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:22:24 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 8 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='two ways to do it:', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:22:28 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 9 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='in this case i'm creating new columns based on a list so if input df has [a,b] and col list has [a,b,c] i create column [c] with NA values and return that df', sender='Asif', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:22:45 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 10 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='1. create a new `DataFrame` with `assign````pythondf_with_sum = df.assign(sum_col=df['a'] + df['b'])```2. modify the original `DataFrame````pythondf['sum_col'] = df['a'] + df['b']```', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:24:17 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 11 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='by slice here do you just mean subset?', sender='Asif', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:24:26 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 12 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='yes', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:24:30 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 13 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='i think in R slice specifically means row selection / filter', sender='Asif', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:24:37 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 14 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='ok cool', sender='Asif', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:24:38 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 15 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='are you familiar with functional programming?', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:24:47 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 16 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='one of the core ideas is that data is immutable so you don't modify stuff only create copies with changes', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:25:05 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 17 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='another thing i'm never sure about  I think so? In the sense of doing one thing and returning it etc?', sender='Asif', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:25:10 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 18 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='doing stuff that way in `pandas` is generally idiomatic', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:25:12 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 19 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='right that makes sense', sender='Asif', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:25:15 CST 2020}
