2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 24 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='the reason you get `SettingWithCopyWarning` is that Python can't tell sometimes whether you're modifying a slice (a subset of the original which would cause it to reflect changes) or a copy', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:26:05 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 25 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='and in some cases the copy can be a throwaway copy (so what you want to modify never gets changed)', sender='Sifeddine', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:26:14 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 26 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=231, text='yea  so in the case of adding a column i should just use assign( ) for each column required', sender='Asif', sentTime=Mon Jan 06 11:26:33 CST 2020}
