2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 5 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=316, text='Characters that represent whitespace like a space and tab. By coincidence all of your escape sequence examples are also whitespace characters (newline carriage return tab)', sender='Katriel', sentTime=Wed Jan 08 07:20:23 CST 2020}
