2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 13 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=316, text='Python abstracts away line breaks for you to just a `\` character in strings but if you write out your file to a Windows filesystem it will actually write out \\r\ since that\'s what\'s needed on windows', sender='Katriel', sentTime=Wed Jan 08 07:24:20 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 14 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=316, text='hmm', sender='Aisley', sentTime=Wed Jan 08 07:24:33 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 15 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=316, text='No the `r` before a string has nothing to do with `\\r`', sender='Katriel', sentTime=Wed Jan 08 07:24:34 CST 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 16 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=316, text='what?', sender='Aisley', sentTime=Wed Jan 08 07:24:37 CST 2020}
