2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 37 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=644, text='the expression `(self.ph if self.ph is not None)` is incomplete. an expression must always have a value. for example `2 if a > b else 3` either has a value of 2 or 3 but it never doesn't have a value. your expression wouldn't have a value if self.ph is None so it wouldn't have anything at all to assign to the dictionary.', sender='Aryah', sentTime=Thu Jan 16 01:32:40 CST 2020}
