2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 47 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=644, text='well think of ternary expressions as being a closed system that doesn't affect anything outside of it', sender='Aryah', sentTime=Thu Jan 16 01:36:35 CST 2020}
