2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 55 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=644, text='the issue with that idea is that you're treating the assignment statement as an expression and statements don't have a value. you can't say `(x = 2) > 3`. it just doesn't make sense because the assignment statement `x = 2` doesn't actually have a value so there isn't anything to compare the `3` to later on in the expression.', sender='Aryah', sentTime=Thu Jan 16 01:43:11 CST 2020}
