2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 19 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=11, text='@salt im reading some examples and they are talking about 3 different types of kernels:```// Implement three different convolutions://  separable  fast convolution for separable kernels//  naive_separable  less fast convolution for separable kernels//  general  handle generate convolution kernels```', sender='Ned', sentTime=Sat Feb 01 08:08:02 CST 2020}
