2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 21 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=11, text='a 2d kernel is separable if it can be written as a sum of 1d kernels', sender='Acisclo', sentTime=Sat Feb 01 08:10:04 CST 2020}
