2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 1 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Yeah I use Nuitka so I was wondering if it still makes Python's .exe file slower than exactly same program made on Rust', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:09:17 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 2 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='And let's say you are not using objects in your program', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:09:38 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 3 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Nuitka also is still very prototypical/rough so I wouldn't assume that what you get from it now will bear any resemblance to what they want to make it into', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:09:44 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 4 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='If all you're doing is relatively straightforward manipulation of scalars then you can get pretty massive speedups with something like Cython', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:10:06 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 5 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='And even some object manipulations can also be sped up but only so much', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:10:23 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 6 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Ah yes marketing. I am not that good in programming yet to dig into Cython and do some custom optimizations unfortunately.', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:10:44 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 7 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='The nice thing about Cython is that it's incremental', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:10:54 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 8 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='that is you start with an existing Python program asis and you add incremental changes to it to speed it up', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:11:06 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 9 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Nice I might look into it later on but I think for now program's internal optimization is more important.', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:11:46 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 10 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Cython would count as such optimization actually', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:12:00 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 11 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Oh you mean I will have to restructure the code to make it Cythoncompatible?', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:12:23 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 12 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Like I said it's incremental', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:12:31 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 13 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='You start with your Python code asis', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:12:37 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 14 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='and then you add changes to it mainly type decorations that make it more amenable to optimization', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:12:58 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 15 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='yes but what do you mean by incremental changes', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:13:06 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 16 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Type hinting', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:13:10 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 17 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='what kind of changes those might be', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:13:16 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 18 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='https://cython.readthedocs.io/en/latest/src/quickstart/cythonize.html', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:13:18 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 19 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Some examples on that page', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:13:25 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 20 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Ah so it's what I was saying you need to rewrite the code to make it Cythoncompatible', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:14:07 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 21 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='yes but the point is you don't have to do it all at once', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:14:16 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 22 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='You can do it in pieces line by line and function by function', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:14:24 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 23 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='True but I think you don't even have to rewrite anything to make Nuitka work 🤔', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:14:50 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 24 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Which is perfect for me because I am constantly prototyping things', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:15:09 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 25 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Yes but Nuitka's optimizations are limited by what it can infer on its own about your program', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:15:14 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 26 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='My suggestion would just be to prototype as you would and then identify the hot spots / bottlenecks', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:15:32 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 27 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='I'm working on a game where I took a few parts of the code that I knew were slow and used Cython on them  I got about 700x improvement in those parts of the code', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:15:55 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 28 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='damn nice', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:16:02 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 29 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='And that was maybe 12 days work', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:16:30 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 30 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='and by days I mean a couple of hours at night after dinner', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:16:39 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 31 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Kinda similar with me. I used to code in 1 thread but then I switched to async and now my program became 100x times faster', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:16:54 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 32 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Yes async is great for certain things', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:17:07 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 33 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='So fast in fact that I need to slow some things down', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:17:21 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 34 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='I am using a lot of http requests', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:17:32 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 35 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='so async saved my as', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:17:37 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 36 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Perfect scenario for it', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:17:56 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 37 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='However it is still relatively new', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:18:05 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 38 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='And I ran into a Python bug that was solved only a month ago', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:18:18 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 39 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='again re: Nuitka the problem is that it has to guess at how to improve things where with Cython you can supply more direct information about how to speed things up', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:18:19 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 40 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='It's slightly more work but the payoffs are massive', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:18:31 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 41 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='also Nuitka programs are massive', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:18:36 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 42 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='True I am also using Nuitka to make cracking of my programs harder. Actually it's the main reason I am using it.', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:19:02 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 43 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='Cython can create code from only one specific module that runs sidebyside with the rest of your Python code asis', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:19:02 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 44 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='My feeling about such things is that it is almost never worth the bother', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:19:15 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 45 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='I mean I discovered a good method for program protection that is used by a lot of game companies', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:19:48 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 46 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='and so far no one was able to reverse engineer my programs', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:20:05 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 47 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='If someone is sufficiently motivated they will find a way', sender='Ramon', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:20:31 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 48 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=542, text='It was actually funny because I made a question on Stackoverflow and 99% of people were telling me to open source the program and do not even try to protect it.Then I went to more specialized reverseengineering forum and got a few very good protection advices lol', sender='Yaniyah', sentTime=Sat Mar 14 04:21:10 CDT 2020}
