2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 1 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='yeah you should look at Corey Shafer's more advanced python tutorials. The only ones I can vouch for are the web app ones (Django and Flask) but he has others in data science.', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:32:25 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 2 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='They are top notch.', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:32:32 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 3 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='I’d like to get into data science. But obviously one should know the basics before. But some other ppl argue that trial by fire is the best way to learn. While that maybe true it may also be a good way to get discouraged and burn out.', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:33:28 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 4 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='And in that case nothing gets accomplished.', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:33:47 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 5 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='I find its a mixture of everything.', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:34:14 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 6 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='If you are thinking about programming you're not doing yourself that badly.', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:34:37 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 7 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Wdym?', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:34:45 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 8 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='You most likely will look back and think I should have done that I would do this now', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:34:46 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 9 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Yeah. True.', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:34:57 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 10 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='But if whether you are fruitlessly trying to make something work that will never work or going over tutorial project #5', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:35:07 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 11 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Its not like its hurting you', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:35:12 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 12 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='the worst thing you can do is stop thinking about programs', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:35:37 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 13 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Thats the only way your progress stops', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:35:43 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 14 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='My biggest issue has always been in gaining confidence with the concepts due to the fact that a lot of tutorials are just rinse and repeating syntax. Which is very important but coding on your own and solving problems is kind of a different ball game.', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:35:56 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 15 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Not because I cant understand the concepts', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:36:11 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 16 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Mainly because a lot of tuts do the same thing', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:36:20 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 17 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Over and over', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:36:23 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 18 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Yeah you do have to try to make thing work on your own at some point. If you've gone over some topic enough that you genuinelyt feel that way you can probbaly make something yourself.', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:36:52 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 19 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='And many times you will hit a wall and the thing you tried to make will not work. In the beginning that is a major thing that stops people from getting further.', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:37:18 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 20 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='You kind of just have top set that stuff to the side find more reading on the subject', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:37:27 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 21 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='And keep thinking about programs', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:37:30 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 22 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Programming is the art of problem solving. That's the way I desire to approach it. Maybe it might be beneficial for me to try to work on small things on my own everyday tbh.', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:37:34 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 23 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Only due to the fact that experimentation can be an awesome way to learn.', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:37:49 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 24 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Syntax is vital nonetheless', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:38:02 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 25 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Otherwise no code is written LOL', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:38:09 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 26 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='But I mean arguably if you can break down big goals into smaller steps then its programmable.', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:38:46 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 27 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='I kind of do both at the same time and always have. I go over exercises tutorial projects all while working on little side things sometimes I go back to old things I make and improve them. If I did the same thing everyday I would get bored with programming tbh', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:38:50 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 28 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='as much as if I singularly focused on one thing id probably get a lot better at it', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:39:01 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 29 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='I would burn out', sender='Heidy', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:39:04 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 30 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Thats what I did^ I hope to learn from your experience so I can make adjustments to my learning.', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:39:21 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 31 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Idk what a good tutorial would be that teaches problem solving', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:40:06 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 32 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Honestly I kind of have an idea', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:40:11 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 33 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Of what I might do', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:40:15 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 34 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='Maybe its dumb', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:40:18 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 35 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=551, text='But maybe its better for me to learn a new concept every day. Then try to apply it.', sender='Abdelelah', sentTime=Sun Apr 12 03:41:05 CDT 2020}
