2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 3 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=996, text='you start at a base commit which for most repos is an empty folder', sender='Antonie', sentTime=Mon Apr 20 22:29:35 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 4 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=996, text='and then you add commits on top of that', sender='Antonie', sentTime=Mon Apr 20 22:29:42 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 5 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=996, text='so you can think of that as a straight line', sender='Antonie', sentTime=Mon Apr 20 22:29:49 CDT 2020}
