2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 7 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=996, text='then you make a branch at a specific point or a specific commit', sender='Antonie', sentTime=Mon Apr 20 22:30:08 CDT 2020}
