2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 1 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='if you the option to use the Django ORM to do SQL for you its the best tool to do that that I have used.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:34:08 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 2 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='Its certainly better than SQL Alchemy', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:34:19 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 3 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=690, text='That being said its not always worth it to use Django jsut for the ORM.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:34:41 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 4 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='But... if you are using Django and concerned about ORM solutions...', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:34:59 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 5 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='Know that it has the best option available for that', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:35:15 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 6 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='I personally dislike SQL Alchemy because it just a library for people who don't have the patience to write a few extra lines of code', sender='Dreya', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:35:27 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 7 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='That's not what it is. when you maintain a database that changes its a pain in the ass. Writing CRUD is easy. But as your database scales and that's pretty much the idea of databases... you know its eventually going to need huge changes migrated to it.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:36:22 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 8 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='Its a matter of time.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:36:26 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 9 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='If you can do that cool but like...', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:36:33 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 10 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='idk. There is much better stuff to think about than SQL.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:36:59 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 11 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='Yeah but I like to write my own code to manage dbs', sender='Dreya', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:37:05 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 12 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='But thats just me I try to use very little libs', sender='Dreya', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:37:36 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 13 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='You're not alone but... shrug... an ORM saves time. I'm tired of wasting time when I program. I do too much of it.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:38:59 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 14 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='I will say this SQL Alchemy is complicated as fuck.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:39:11 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 15 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='Its almost fair to say that it sometimes is probably simpler to use SQL.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:39:22 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 16 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='yeah', sender='Dreya', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:39:30 CDT 2020}
