2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 18 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='But Django ORM is the best.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:39:35 CDT 2020}
