2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 21 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='And it will just migrate perfectly.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:39:59 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 22 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='You sound like a dev that is trying to advertise Django ORM', sender='Dreya', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:40:27 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 23 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='Honestly I dont use Django very much because I prefer Flask in almost everything.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:40:44 CDT 2020}
