2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 28 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='It's more enjoyable to work with but there are some projects that I think Django would save the most time to use.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:41:59 CDT 2020}
