2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 36 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='I really dont like to think about making games. It seems stressful extremely time consuming and hard to pull off. The user base of gamers seem to be largely unappreciative people. I know that software users can generally be like that but there\'s a difference when a program you make is an expression of yourself like a game is and when its something you make strictly for utility and when the user says This is a problem you just fix it.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:46:10 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 37 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='When you pour your soul into a game as much effort goes into it as it requires... I just dont want to.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:46:25 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 38 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=688, text='Because I know how it will most likely be received.', sender='Yitzy', sentTime=Thu May 14 04:46:48 CDT 2020}
