2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 1 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='I want to host everything. This is how a normal business owner should interact with the dashboard:They navigate to the website (`aiodash.io`) they click on `Buy now` they subscribe to monthly renewal license through stripe once payment is confirmed a new instance of the dashboard and the discord bot is initialized and a single owner license key is generated and sent along with the website link to the owner then they will be able to generate keys that they can pass to the users of their business', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 10:59:40 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 2 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='But instead of having delivery wait time I would like the process to be automatic', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:00:00 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 3 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='ah ok', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:00:05 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 4 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='do you have any container experience?', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:00:21 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 5 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='I do have but I am not confident in using it for b2b', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:00:31 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 6 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='as this is going to be a very expensive service I want to be 100% sure of what to do', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:00:49 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 7 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='ok so I do kubernetes for a living and have a SaaS product offering that has some similarities to your problem', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:01:09 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 8 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='Oof feels great that someone can understand my problem', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:01:37 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 9 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='I will say hands down containerization is the way to go and using kubernetes to manage the lifecycle of your containers is a huge value add', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:01:41 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 10 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='now we can communicate with kubernetes over a REST API', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:01:58 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 11 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='so we can spin up/deprovision your container(s) for new/old clients', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:02:09 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 12 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='that's about all there is to it.. minus the fluff in between', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:02:23 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 13 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='Hmm the thing is that I want the new dashboard to be accompanied by the following domain format: ```https://www.companyname.aiodash.io```', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:02:47 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 14 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='How would I go by creating discrete subdomains?', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:02:55 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 15 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='perfectly fine', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:02:58 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 16 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='you would use a wildcard DNS record and point it to the kubernetes ingress controller (basically nginx that proxies to the respective container based on the matching hostname)', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:03:27 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 17 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='so you could do <anything>.aiodash.io', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:03:35 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 18 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='Hmm', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:04:25 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 19 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='Feels possible and not that hard', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:04:33 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 20 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='What do you think is the best host for k8s?', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:04:46 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 21 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='are you already in the cloud/have a provider you're comfortable with?', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:05:06 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 22 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='I use aws', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:05:12 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 23 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='GCP is going to be the cheapest... AWS EKS is garbage ( I fight it daily ) and kinda expensive.. and Azure AKS is the most expensive but is amazing', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:05:43 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 24 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='Basically the membership to this service will be at 500$/month per user', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:06:07 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 25 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='Do you think it is enough for each dashboard instance?', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:06:13 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 26 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='There is no heavy processing only database I/Os and api usage', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:06:30 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 27 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='oh yea easily', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:07:46 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 28 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='you could run probably 4050 30mb~ containers for around $2530/mo on GCP tbh', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:08:16 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 29 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='I was originally thinking at 50$/mo for each instance', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:08:34 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 30 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='Also if I wanted to push updates to the dashboard would I just update the original image and just redeploy it to all containers?', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:09:05 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 31 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='charge what you can get away with I say.. just enough to make sure you don't scare off new potential clients and not soo high that your existing clients start looking at alternatives', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:09:23 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 32 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='The price is just fine I already have quite a few preorders', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:09:43 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 33 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='build docker image > push to image repo > kubernetes > update image tag > done', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:09:46 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 34 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='nice', sender='Carah', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:09:54 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 35 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='I want to differ from the competition by providing supreme quality and performance', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:10:19 CDT 2020}
2025-04-06 17:14:27 INFO  s.u.e.m.file.util.TextFileExport - 	 36 Msg: MessageAnalysisVO{disentangledId=1209, text='Alright is it okay if I dmed you at some point because I might get some problems whilst setting this up', sender='Amely', sentTime=Sat Jun 20 11:10:38 CDT 2020}
